cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Biomedical Literature Analysis: PubMed Corpus Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that harvests, verifies, and cleans US-affiliated
  PubMed abstracts (1994-2025) and analyses them for disease and chemical
  trends, MeSH and keyword structure, co-authorship networks, the COVID-19
  publishing shock, and latent topics.
type: software
authors:
